# Allow-list: only what the image needs (Dockerfile: COPY requirements.txt, COPY . .).
# A new top-level module goes here too — otherwise `import main` in the image
# fails in CI («image builds and starts»), not on a user's server. Keys
# (gsc-key.json), .env, data, tests, docs and audit notes never get in.
*
!main.py
!config.py
!entrypoint.sh
!requirements.txt
!LICENSE
!db
!handlers
!monitors
!reports
!services
!utils
!web
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
